# "Whenever you cast a spell from anywhere other than your hand, you may cast a permanent spell with equal or lesser mana value
# from your hand without paying its mana cost." Casting Wrenn's Resolve from hand asks nothing. Casting Mind Stone (mana value 2)
# from exile does: Memnite (0, lesser) is cast free, the Island is refused (not a spell), and because a spell was cast the
# Island is not put onto the battlefield.

